reactor-effect-browser

This independent SDK is not an official Reactor SDK.

The browser-media implementation incorporates the user-supplied
reactor-effect-client reference source. Protocol material, the canonical
session implementation and their upstream notices are distributed with the
reactor-effect-client package this host depends on.

Transport uses the browser's built-in RTCPeerConnection and media tracks; no
WebRTC engine is shipped by this package.

Effect is MIT-licensed. The package declares Effect as a peer dependency; its
license is retained in notices/effect-LICENSE. Development tooling and
node_modules are excluded from the npm package.
